\f1\b0 1. Li\uc0\u7879 t k\'ea chi ti\u7871 t c\'e1c file, th\u432  m\u7909 c trong th\u432  m\u7909 c /hdhlinux bao g\u7891 m c\'e1c file \u7849 n\
