8. Sao ch\'e9p to\'e0n b\uc0\u7897  th\u432  m\u7909 c /var/www/html sang th\u432  m\u7909 c /tmp/backup/ sao cho gi\u7919  nguy\'ean c\u7845 u tr\'fac\
